    "internalNotes": "Silkwood School, three Year 1 classes (20-22 per class), booked at 66 children. Two base activities plus Pond Explorers, at $19.50 a child. Quoted to the school in writing on 26 August as $1,287.00. Rezdy is adding a 3 per cent tax line of $38.61 on top; invoice the school at the quoted $1,287.00 unless the Director decides otherwise. Students bring their own lunch. Adult supervisor numbers still to be confirmed. Coach window to be confirmed by the school; session listed at 09:45 to 13:15. Monday is outside the usual Tuesday-to-Friday window, so this day needs rostering deliberately. Raised from Lucy Briggs&#039;s email request of 25 August 2026.",
